By the way, if you want to know how the Goyim celebrate, you know how the Goyim celebrate the holidays?

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:24.420
I'll tell you exactly how they celebrate, so you understand the way we celebrate.

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:29.520
Any of you watched last night's Oscar?

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:31.060
Yes.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.080
