00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:33.640
Yes.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.260
What happened with the Oscars?

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:42.620
Oscars thinks you, people, I understand a billion people watch how other people, what happened to other people, correct?

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:45.060
Has nothing to do with your life.

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:49.280
This is the going holidays.

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.580
It's always what happened to somebody else.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.660
Jesus was born, he died, he had a headache,

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:59.500
he had a problem, he didn't go this way, and so on.

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:01.460
