00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:04.720
Jewish holidays, this is important.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:06.960
Now you're going to the core of Jewish holidays.

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:12.440
Jewish holidays deal exclusively with what happened to us.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:33.140
You see, there are always events on the Jewish people. Passover, the birth of the Jewish people, freedom. Shabu'ot, receiving of the Tora, the law. Sukkot, 40 years wandering the desert.

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:49.140
Roshana, we are being judged. Yom Kippur, God is not forgiving us. Tish'a be-Ab, our homeland was taken over by the enemy.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:54.140
Hanukka, we fought against the Greeks and we won.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:03:02.140
Purim, the Persians want to annihilate, commit genocide, and we were able to outmaneuver them.

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:06.140
It is always what's happening to us.

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:12.140
Now, how do we celebrate Pesah? It's interesting.

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:17.680
there is a group of people who were slaves.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:19.260
Right?

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:23.800
Now, these slaves attained freedom.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.720
Now, one minute.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:31.780
Forget about you, me, Jewish people.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.340
Just think of two words.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.720
Slaves, in plural.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:40.180
And the second word, freedom.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:04:03.340
Now, join these two words together. What comes to your mind? Slaves, the free. What comes to your mind immediately? Anarchy, violence, strife. Yeah? That's normal.

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:09.260
Slaves, make a combination, slaves and freedom.

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:10.960
Yes?

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:16.480
The combination is anarchy, chaos.

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:17.700
One minute.

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:23.700
How do we celebrate Passover?

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:31.440
What is the antithesis of anarchy, chaos?

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:35.200
What's the antithesis?

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:44.260
If you have to have the opposite concept of chaos and anarchy, what would that be?

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:46.580
What?

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:48.500
Order.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:50.520
