00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:52.000
Seder.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.020
We celebrate.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:56.520
See?

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.640
It pays to be intelligent.

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:00.220
All right?

