00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:19.240
You know, the Sepharadi yeshiva in Israel, many of our boys, they're going there.

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:22.040
Welcome to our place, Rabbi Shammoula.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:26.380
Now, the word is said, it is interesting.

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.480
we celebrate

