Only people who have an orderly life, who have an orderly way of thinking,

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:15.320
who are organized, who have a seder, all right,

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:24.820
only those people and those alone could really know whether they are free or not.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:28.060
Or to put it in different words.

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:37.120
If somebody says that he is free, you could know whether this person is free or not by looking into his or her life.

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:41.260
Do they live an orderly life?

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:45.200
Is there a setter in the life?

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:50.180
If there is a setter in the life, then they are free.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:59.760
If there is no Seder in the life, they may think that they are free, but in point of fact, they are slaves.

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:01.380
You understand?

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:08.300
Only through Seder you could really know whether you are or you are not free.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.320
That is the criterion.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.180
Are you following me?

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:13.140
All right?

